        "tag": "Why",
        "title": "Why Twilite Exists",
        "body": "Most tools split thinking across chats, docs, tabs, whiteboards, and disconnected notes. Twilite keeps the structure itself in view. The graph becomes the thing with value: addressable, inspectable, editable, and durable on the web.",
