        "eyebrow": "Proof",
        "title": "What Already Works Today",
        "claims": "- Twilite already runs in the browser.\n- It already persists graphs.\n- It already exposes them at addresses.\n- It already supports AI-assisted graph authoring.\n- It already supports GitHub-backed save and publish flows.\n- This page is itself part of that system.",
